// Enterprise flows: a multi-step provisioning wizard and an audit log
// Shows: a three-step wizard with a progress indicator: a step blocked by a validation error, the same step valid (a duplicate with three properties changed), and a review step with edit links, all with a cost summary that stays in view; an audit log whose rows are 25 instances of one local component, bound with the header to the xs size token, with filters and an event-detail panel; prototype links that follow the real paths (fix the field, next, back, edit; open and close an event)
// in: 11-enterprise/51-enterprise-component-library-on-carbon-tokens
// The chrome, the form controls, the notifications, the buttons and the pagination are instances of library components. The audit table is local to this file (its header is a frame, its rows are instances of a component made here), and so are the page titles, the progress indicator, the filters and the review lists, all on the same tokens. Find the mains once; node.find matches names as substrings, so each name here is unique in the file.
